OL,5,BAbout                                  
OL,6, Teletext program showing live pages    
OL,7, from the internet for theFCommodore 64 
OL,8,FUltimateGand other Ultimate products   
OL,9, that have networking capabilities like 
OL,10, theFUltimate 64Gseries and theFUltimate
OL,11,FII+Gcartridge.                         
OL,13, TheFWiC64GandFMeatloafGdevices are also
OL,14, supported. And it also runs inFVICE.   
OL,16,BSupported hardware                     
OL,17, The program runs on an original stock  
OL,18, C64 (or C128 in C64 mode). If run on a 
OL,19, modern C64 Ultimate/Ultimate 64, it    
OL,20, can make use of high CPU clock speeds  
OL,21, for near instant page rendering and a  
OL,22, VICE compatible teletext palette file. 
